{
  "summary": "The experiment tested an RNA-only model using PCA_n2000 encoding without image modality or fusion, establishing a baseline for RNA-only performance. Validation accuracy of 0.485 suggests moderate viability for RNA-only approaches, supported by a validation F1 score of 0.464. The lack of comparative data leaves uncertainty about how this baseline performs relative to multimodal or image-based configurations."
}

